docs {
  # Get Crystal Band Seed Status

  This endpoint retrieves the tenant's crystal band seed catalog status.

  ## Response

  ```json
  {
    "groupName": "crystalBands",
    "subdomains": {
      "crystalBands": {
        "count": 5,
        "updatedAt": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z"
      }
    },
    "updatedAt": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z",
    "catalogRevision": "abc123",
    "tenantSeededRevision": "abc123",
    "tenantSeededAt": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z"
  }
  ```
}
